<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar o/night rates up at 1.89 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar o/night rates up at 1.89 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 1.89 percent on Saturday from 1.82 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded in 20 reported transactions worth 50.6 million dinars.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
